<main class="app-page app-about">
  <header class="app-page__heading">
    <p class="app-eyebrow">Why Voterr exists</p>
    <h1>Less debating.<br><span>More watching.</span></h1>
    <p>Voterr turns your Plex library into a shared shortlist, so everyone gets a say and movie night actually starts on time.</p>
  </header>

  <div class="app-about__grid">
    <section class="app-card app-about__story">
      <p class="app-card__kicker">Built for the couch</p>
      <h2>A fairer way to pick</h2>
      <p>Connect Plex, create a room, and invite friends with one link. Guests vote without making an account. When everyone likes the same title, that movie wins.</p>
      <p>Voterr is open source and designed to keep the group focused on the fun part: watching something together.</p>
    </section>

    <section class="app-card app-about__steps">
      <p class="app-card__kicker">Five simple steps</p>
      <ol>
        <li><span>01</span>Connect your Plex library</li>
        <li><span>02</span>Create a voting session</li>
        <li><span>03</span>Invite your friends</li>
        <li><span>04</span>Vote on movie picks</li>
        <li><span>05</span>Enjoy the winner</li>
      </ol>
    </section>
  </div>

  <footer class="app-about__attribution">
    <p>Movie metadata is provided by TMDB. Voterr is not endorsed or certified by TMDB.</p>
